olor":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-03-24T22:34:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T08:42:57Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4 where typed Dictionary's where Added\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.4, Windows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs of Godot 4.4 we do now have typed Dictionary's\nWe can use them via @export\nKeys of existing/added Entry's cant be changed via the inspector afterwards, only before we add them\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- add key / value pair to the dict via the inspector\n- after adding, you cant change the key, only the value\n- Screenshot: i cant edit \"test\"\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68909b7f-8e5a-4bbb-a1d6-4e7c96a76b43)\n\nWorkaround:\nRemove entry and add a new one\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nexample Code\ncreate empty project an add script to any node, like node2d:\n```\nextends Node2D\n\n@export var dict : Dictionary[String,int]\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581/reactions","total_count":21,"+1":21,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}